CM_ "CHARGING MODE CORRECTION: Manager30 charging mode is decoded from DGN 0x1F200 D1 bit0. DGN 0x1F108 is load-disconnect configuration and must not be used for Touring/Storage state.";

CM_ BO_ 2213611520 "Manager30 DGN 0x1F108 is load-disconnect configuration, not charging-mode status. D1 bits2-4 decode the load-disconnect trigger.";
CM_ SG_ 2213611520 ConfigFlag0Raw "D1 bit0 is an unresolved configuration flag; do not decode it as ChargingMode.";
CM_ SG_ 2213611520 ConfigFlag1Raw "Unresolved D1 bit1.";
CM_ SG_ 2213611520 LoadDisconnectTrigger "Confirmed enum: 0 Always, 1 BMS Voltage, 2 BMS SOC, 3 Never, 4 Voltage.";
CM_ SG_ 2213611520 ConfigHighFlagsRaw "Unresolved D1 bits5-7; observed high bits are normally set.";

CM_ BO_ 2213675008 "Manager30 charging-stage and charging-mode status. ChargingMode = D1 bit0, where 0=Touring and 1=Storage. ChargingStageBase is D1 with bit0 masked off (D1 & 0xFE).";
CM_ SG_ 2213675008 ChargingStageCode "Complete raw D1 stage/mode byte.";
CM_ SG_ 2213675008 ChargingMode "D1 bit0. 0=Touring mode, 1=Storage mode.";
CM_ SG_ 2213675008 ChargingStageBase "Bits1-7 with factor 2; displayed value equals D1 & 0xFE. Confirmed stage bases: 0x00 Not Charging, 0x10 Desulphation, 0x20 Soft Start, 0x30 Boost, 0x40 Absorption, 0x50 Battery Test, 0x60 Equalize, 0x70 Float, 0x80 Maintenance.";
CM_ SG_ 2213675008 ChargerRatedCurrent_Candidate "D2 candidate rated/configured charger current. This field remains unconfirmed.";

CM_ BO_ 2399207168 "Broadcast setting command from a RedVision display. Command 0x43 sets Touring/Storage mode. storage locked.csv also contains command 0x4D with value 1 and an acknowledgement from TVMS1280; this is a strong Storage-mode-lock candidate but requires a controlled lock-off capture before confirmation.";
CM_ SG_ 2399207168 SetChargingMode "Command 0x43: 0 Touring, 1 Storage. This is a state-changing command, not a periodic status signal.";
CM_ SG_ 2399207168 StorageModeLock_Candidate "Command 0x4D candidate: storage locked.csv contains value 1 while the system was locked to Storage mode. Confirm by toggling the lock off and capturing value 0.";
CM_ SG_ 2399142144 SetChargingMode "Addressed Manager30 command 0x43: 0 Touring, 1 Storage.";

